.TH MYSTRFUNCTIONS 3 "September 2026" "v0.4.1" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrfunctions \- String manipulation utility functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.br
.BI "int mystrcpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.br
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.br
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrfunctions
module provides standard custom string operations.
.TP
.BR mystrlen ()
Computes the length of string \fIs\fP excluding the null terminator.
.TP
.BR mystrcat ()
Appends string \fIsrc\fP to \fIdest\fP.
